*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : PAY0018
*> PURPOSE : PAYROLL DEDUCTIONS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : L.B.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-02-19 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-12-04 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 756
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB PAYNIGHT STEP010
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PAY0018.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    COPY PAY0018C.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    05 BENEFITS-ELIG      PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    *> PENSION CONTRIBUTION RATE
    05 PENS-CONTRIB-RT    PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM CHECK-BENEFITS
    PERFORM SET-PENSION
    DISPLAY "BENEFITS-ELIG=" BENEFITS-ELIG
    DISPLAY "PENS-CONTRIB-RT=" PENS-CONTRIB-RT
    STOP RUN.
CHECK-BENEFITS.
    *> BENEFITS ELIGIBILITY
    IF EMP-CLASS = 'F'
       OR (EMP-CLASS = 'P' AND WEEK-HOURS >= 20)
        MOVE 'Y' TO BENEFITS-ELIG
    END-IF.
SET-PENSION.
    *> PENSION CONTRIBUTION RATE
    IF PENSION-OPTIN = 'Y'
       AND YRS-SERVICE GREATER THAN OR EQUAL TO 2
        MOVE 0.0600 TO PENS-CONTRIB-RT
    ELSE
        MOVE 0.0200 TO PENS-CONTRIB-RT
    END-IF.
